Condition-bearing statements also collect `affected_symbols` for the
Pyright-style branch-skipping optimization used during backward CFG walks in
type narrowing. A coalescing step then groups single-in/single-out chains
into basic blocks, and `printgraph_cfg` renders the block graph as dot text.
